## Setting Up MySQL

1. Install MySQL and create a banking database.

2. Configure db.properties
db.url=jdbc:mysql://localhost:3306/banking  -> add your own configurations
db.name=root
db.password=yourpassword


3. Run the app — it will auto-create necessary tables.


## Running the Application
    Compile and run the Main class from the app package.
    Follow on-screen prompts in the console UI to register, login, and manage accounts.

## Testing
    Unit tests are located in the test package and use JUnit.
    Integration tests cover database operations.
    Run tests using your IDE or build tool (e.g., Maven, Gradle).

